  "description": "If you have an iPad and PROCREATE app, you’ll be happy to add light painting brushes to your collection!\nAdd a spark of magic to your digital art with this set of 30 Light Painting Brushes for Procreate! Each brush is designed to create a unique light effect, perfect for glowing strokes, neon highlights, and vibrant illustrations.\nWith these brushes, you can draw with light just like in time-lapse photography—creating dazzling trails, glowing letters, or magical shapes that seem to shine off the screen.\nFeatures:\n• 30 Procreate brushes\n• 30 different light effects\n• Easy to draw\n• Pen pressure sensitive\nHow To Use:\n1. Download the files on your iPad\n2. Click on .brushset files\n3. Procreate will automatically install all the brushes and they will appear at the top of your brush list\nThey’re easy to use, pressure-sensitive, and ideal for lettering, portraits, abstract art, or any creative project that needs a glowing, dynamic touch!\nFeel free to contact if you have a question. I’ll help you with pleasure)",
  "fullDescription": "<p>If you have an iPad and PROCREATE app, you’ll be happy to add light painting brushes to your collection!</p>\n<p>Add a spark of magic to your digital art with this set of 30 Light Painting Brushes for Procreate! Each brush is designed to create a unique light effect, perfect for glowing strokes, neon highlights, and vibrant illustrations.</p>\n<p>With these brushes, you can draw with light just like in time-lapse photography—creating dazzling trails, glowing letters, or magical shapes that seem to shine off the screen.</p>\n<p>Features:<br>\n• 30 Procreate brushes<br>\n• 30 different light effects<br>\n• Easy to draw<br>\n• Pen pressure sensitive</p>\n<p>How To Use:<br>\n1. Download the files on your iPad<br>\n2. Click on .brushset files<br>\n3. Procreate will automatically install all the brushes and they will appear at the top of your brush list</p>\n<p>They’re easy to use, pressure-sensitive, and ideal for lettering, portraits, abstract art, or any creative project that needs a glowing, dynamic touch!</p>\n<p>Feel free to contact if you have a question. I’ll help you with pleasure)</p>",
